%% Mini Player 1 — displayMode FSM (ADR-188, RF-04 + RF-11 + RF-13)
%% Estados validos: hidden | bar | expanded. Transicoes nomeadas alinhadas
%% as pure functions em client/src/lib/audio-engine/displayModeFsm.ts.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> hidden : boot / refresh / reload

    hidden --> bar : playTrack(track)<br/>(nextOnPlayTrack)
    hidden --> hidden : Esc / close (no-op)
    hidden --> hidden : fullscreen exit + current===null

    bar --> expanded : click cover<br/>OR chevron-up<br/>OR setDisplayMode('expanded')
    bar --> hidden : close X<br/>OR Esc<br/>(nextOnClose / nextOnEsc)
    bar --> hidden : onEnded sem proxima<br/>(RF-05 tryAutoplayNext)
    bar --> hidden : fullscreen enter<br/>(LessonViewer requestFullscreen)<br/>(nextOnFullscreenEnter)
    bar --> bar : playTrack(novaTrack)<br/>(D9 substitui sem confirmacao)

    expanded --> bar : click chevron-down<br/>OR Esc<br/>OR click backdrop<br/>OR setDisplayMode('bar')<br/>(nextOnEsc)
    expanded --> hidden : close X<br/>(direto — slide-down 200ms a partir do expanded)
    expanded --> hidden : fullscreen enter
    expanded --> expanded : playTrack(novaTrack) via LessonPicker<br/>(D9 + RF-09: preserva expanded)

    hidden --> bar : fullscreen exit + current!==null<br/>(nextOnFullscreenExit restore)

    note right of hidden
        current === null (invariante)
        MiniPlayerBar retorna null
        MiniPlayerExpanded nao renderiza
        --mini-player-height: 0px
    end note

    note right of bar
        Surface principal — z-40
        9 controles RF-02 conforme breakpoint RF-10
        --mini-player-height: 64/72/80px
        MiniChat (z-50) fica acima
    end note

    note right of expanded
        Painel z-45 acima da bar
        Cover 120x120 rotate (RF-12)
        Lista readonly aulas do courseContext
        Bar permanece visivel
        Trap focus dentro do painel
        Backdrop click minimiza
    end note

    note left of [*]
        Sem persist cross-session
        (D4 + D7 + D8: refresh = hidden)
        State invalido prevenido:
        setDisplayMode('expanded') com
        current===null = no-op + console.warn
    end note
